# Disk images

The committed sample images will land in M4:

- `cpm22-sssd.img` — 8" SSSD 256KB, contains CCP, BDOS, BIOS + utilities (PIP, STAT, ED, DDT, SUBMIT, SYSGEN)
- `cpm22-ssdd.img` — 8" SSDD 512KB, same content, double-density format

This `.gitkeep` ensures the directory is tracked even before M4 ships.
